    <string name="repo_gpg_no_key_title">No GPG key found</string>
    <string name="repo_gpg_no_key_message">To sign the repo you need your own GPG key — Kairos never generates it automatically or in the background, you have to create it yourself.\n\nOpen a terminal session (Kairos\'s terminal button) and run:\n\n  gpg --full-generate-key\n\nFollow the instructions (key type, size, your own passphrase). When it\'s done, come back here and tap \"Sign repo with GPG\" again.</string>
